      "id": 135157,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-03T01:36:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>On the app this is nearly impossible.</p><p>It's hard with cards, but Tempest didn't take 17 damage on Baron's 2nd turn with my cards. &nbsp;he did that in the app.</p><p>I flipped him once in three plays on advanced, and that was with good hands, the time I did flip him we incapped the turn we flipped him.</p><p>So I beat him with cards, lost 4 straight times on the app.</p><p>Seriously, play Localized Hurricane and see how much one shot damage hits Tempest the next round, either this app hates me or it cheats.</p><p>Either way I love it.</p>",
