      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/ecae2f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-06T02:30:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>On my 13th try I finallly got him.&nbsp; With a couple of asterisks... I swapped out G.I. Bunker for the plain jane&nbsp;version, and I changed the order to Tempest-G.I.-Haka.&nbsp; Even my victory didn't provide much satisfaction.&nbsp; I actually like MBB - his games go by quickly, and sometimes that's important&nbsp;- but this is not the team to face him with, IMHO.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9408d2cdb0a6c12426a5daed0c22fc1fa07a1611.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/9408d2cdb0a6c12426a5daed0c22fc1fa07a1611\" title=\"2015-03-05_00001.jpg\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9408d2cdb0a6c12426a5daed0c22fc1fa07a1611_2_690x388.jpeg\" alt=\"2015-03-05_00001.jpg\" data-base62-sha1=\"l7zzkfif958j4yxCsks62vS72pP\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9408d2cdb0a6c12426a5daed0c22fc1fa07a1611_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9408d2cdb0a6c12426a5daed0c22fc1fa07a1611_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9408d2cdb0a6c12426a5daed0c22fc1fa07a1611_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9408d2cdb0a6c12426a5daed0c22fc1fa07a1611_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">2015-03-05_00001.jpg</span><span class=\"informations\">1600×900 459 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
